      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shippingport%2C_Pennsylvania"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The town’s river location made it a key steamboat construction site in the 1850s, more a ferry terminal than a freight port.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        26
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
